    {
      "index": 5,
      "type": "figure",
      "narration": "Now, the duodenoscope. At its distal tip is an elevator, a small lever that raises to direct accessories. Its recess is narrow, mechanically complex and extremely difficult to clean. It has been implicated in international outbreaks of multidrug-resistant organisms. Follow the manufacturer's elevator instructions exactly.",
      "audioFile": "audio/vo/ms-cssd-15/V804/scene-5.mp3",
      "voDurationInSeconds": 24.576,
      "voDurationInFrames": 738,
      "leadFrames": 26,
      "tailFrames": 44,
      "durationInFrames": 808,
      "startFrame": 2295,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "Now, the duodenoscope.",
          "start": 0.098,
          "end": 2.197
        },
        {
          "text": "At its distal tip is an elevator, a small",
          "start": 2.861,
          "end": 5.757
        },
        {
          "text": "lever that raises to direct accessories.",
          "start": 5.757,
          "end": 8.481
        },
        {
          "text": "Its recess is narrow, mechanically complex",
          "start": 9.171,
          "end": 11.875
        },
        {
          "text": "and extremely difficult to clean.",
          "start": 11.875,
          "end": 13.998
        },
        {
          "text": "It has been implicated in international",
          "start": 14.688,
          "end": 16.815
        },
        {
          "text": "outbreaks of multidrug-resistant",
          "start": 16.815,
          "end": 18.618
        },
        {
          "text": "organisms. Follow the manufacturer's",
          "start": 18.618,
          "end": 21.755
        },
        {
          "text": "elevator instructions exactly.",
          "start": 21.755,
          "end": 23.902
        }
